### Genfeed HeyGen catalogs (backed by HeyGen API v3)

### Available renderable avatar looks
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/heygen/avatars
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Public and connected-account voices
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/heygen/voices
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Connection status
GET {{apiBaseUrl}}/heygen/status
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

### Submit an avatar video through the application billing flow
POST {{apiBaseUrl}}/videos/avatar
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "avatarId": "{{heygenAvatarId}}",
  "heygenVoiceId": "{{heygenVoiceId}}",
  "text": "Welcome to our presentation"
}
